sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Logistics User
    participant Browser as React Frontend
    participant Server as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    User->>Browser: Enters Email and Password
    Browser->>Server: POST /api/auth/login
    Server->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE LOWER(email) = LOWER($1)
    DB-->>Server: User row with bcrypt hash
    Server->>Server: bcrypt.compare(plainPassword, user.password)
    
    alt Password Valid
        Server->>Server: jwt.sign({ id: user.id }, JWT_SECRET)
        Server-->>Browser: Set-Cookie: token (HttpOnly, SameSite=Strict) + User Object
        Browser-->>User: Redirect to Dashboard
    else Invalid Credentials
        Server-->>Browser: 401 Unauthorized ("Invalid email or password")
        Browser-->>User: Show error toast alert
    end

    Note over User,Browser: Authenticated API Request Flow

    User->>Browser: Opens Freight Bills Page
    Browser->>Server: GET /api/freight-bills (Cookie automatically sent)
    Server->>Server: jwt.verify(req.cookies.token, JWT_SECRET)
    Server->>DB: Query bills with joins & pagination
    DB-->>Server: Rows array
    Server-->>Browser: 200 OK with bills payload
    Browser-->>User: Renders Data Table
